{"sections":[{"slug":"近复结构","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"近复结构"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">近复结构</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"近复结构"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">关于向量空间上的近复结构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/复向量空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">复向量空间</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">实流形</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">近复结构</span></strong> (almost complex structure) <span lang=\"zh\">是切丛</span> $TM$ <span lang=\"zh\">的自同构</span> $J$, <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span>\n$$\r\nJ^2 = -1.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">此时称</span> $(M,J)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">近复流形</span></strong>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">实</span> $2n$ <span lang=\"zh\">维流形</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">的切丛对应映射</span> $M \\to BGL(2n,\\mathbb{R})$, <span lang=\"zh\">而近复结构</span> $J$ <span lang=\"zh\">等同于提升</span> $M\\to BGL(n,\\mathbb{C}) \\to BGL(2n,\\mathbb{R})$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">可积性</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">近复结构</span> $J$ <span lang=\"zh\">可积是指它来自一个复结构</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/复流形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">复流形</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">可积条件与如下条件等价</span>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$[T^{0,1}M,T^{0,1}M]\\subset T^{0,1}M$;</li>\n<li>$d C^\\infty (\\wedge^{1,0}M) \\subset C^\\infty (\\wedge^{2,0}M\\oplus \\wedge^{1,1}M)$.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">全纯映射</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">近复流形的映射</span> $f\\colon (M,J)\\to (M',J')$ <span lang=\"zh\">称为</span> $(J,J')$-<span lang=\"zh\">全纯映射是指</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对任意</span> $x\\in M$ <span lang=\"zh\">有如下交换图</span>:\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n\t{ccc}\r\n\tT_xM&amp;\\overset{df}{\\to}&amp; T_{f(x)M'}\\\\\r\n\t\\hspace{-1em}J \\downarrow&amp;&amp;\\downarrow J\\hspace{-1em}\\\\\r\n\tT_xM&amp;\\underset{df}{\\to}&amp; T_{f(x)}M'\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">近复结构</span> $J$ <span lang=\"zh\">可积等价于存在</span> $(J,i)$-<span lang=\"zh\">全纯的坐标卡</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">当</span> $(M,J)$ <span lang=\"zh\">不可积时</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">通常没有</span> $(M,J)$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $\\mathbb{C}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的全纯映射</span>.</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Riemann面","text":"Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">面</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">到近复流形的全纯映射称为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/J-全纯曲线","text":"J-<span lang=\"zh\">全纯曲线</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">近复流形的实维数是偶数</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">这是因为</span> $\\det J^2 = (-1)^{\\dim_{\\mathbb{R}} M}$, <span lang=\"zh\">而</span> $\\det J\\in\\mathbb{R}$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">近复流形有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结构群的约化","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结构群的约化</span>"}},{"Plain":" $GL(n,\\mathbb{C})\\to GL(2n,\\mathbb{R})$, <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $2n=\\dim_{\\mathbb{R}} M$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">与</span> Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">流形的关系</span></h3>\n<p>…</p>\n<p>$$\r\ng(JX,JY)=g(X,Y)\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Levi-Civita联络","text":"Levi-Civita <span lang=\"zh\">联络</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\nabla$ <span lang=\"zh\">若有</span> $\\nabla J = 0$ <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $(M,g,J)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Kähler流形","text":"Kähler <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">相容三元组</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">相容三元组是指</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">度量</span> $g$, <span lang=\"zh\">近复结构</span> $J$ <span lang=\"zh\">与辛形式</span> $\\omega$, <span lang=\"zh\">满足以下条件</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">即三个结构中的任意一个可由另外两个表示</span>):</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$g(X,Y)=\\omega(X,JY)$;</li>\n<li>$\\omega(X,Y)=g(JX,Y)$;</li>\n<li>$JX=g^{-1}(\\omega(X,-))$.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">这与</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/酉群的三选二性质","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">酉群的三选二性质</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">有关</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">实</span> 2 <span lang=\"zh\">维的情形</span></h3>\n<p>$2$ <span lang=\"zh\">维实流形上的任意近复结构都可积</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">这是因为可积性等价于</span> $\\bar\\partial^2=0$, <span lang=\"zh\">而这在实</span> $2$ <span lang=\"zh\">维情形自动成立</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}